<title>USA: Heartland Express acquires Tenn. company.</title>
<headline>Heartland Express acquires Tenn. company.</headline>
<dateline>CORALVILLE, Iowa 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Heartland Express Inc, a transportation company, said Thursday it acquired A &amp; M Express Inc, a Kingsport, Tenn. based trucking company with 1996 gross revenues of $28 million.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>			 ((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8787))</p>
